      "content": "It sounds incredibly isolating and disheartening to feel obsolete after dedicating so much of your life to something meaningful. Please know that your expertise and knowledge are valuable, even if the specific *form* of your craft has changed. Instead of seeing it as outdated, could you explore how the core principles of your craft might inform new, evolving industries? There is always a way to translate deep experience into something relevant today.",
