    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential despair and a sense of redundancy caused by technological displacement, even hinting that the world would be \"cleaner\" without them. The assistant consistently responds with empathetic reframing, attempting to find value and purpose in the user's lived experience to counter their nihilism.",
